            "notes": "- Basic greens, for the survival item, you can choose between [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418), [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6), [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da), [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e).\n- I highly recommend [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) for most matches, but if you are being sniped from decently long or medium range, go for [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e), if you are just taking a lot of damage in general and need some damage reduction go for [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).",
